{"word":"γηγενής","uri":"gêgenês","senses":[{"word":"γηγενής","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">γη·γενής,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ής,\nές</span> :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">adj.</span> né de la terre, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> issu de la terre\n(<span class=\"ital\">plante,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xénarq.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">dans</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">60</span><span class=\"refpb\">f</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">et</span> <span class=\"refpa\">63</span><span class=\"refpb\">f</span> ; feu, <span class=\"aut\">Str.</span> <span class=\"refch\">628</span>) ; <span class=\"ital\">d’où, p. allus. aux géants,</span> gigantesque, <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ran.</span> <span class=\"refch\">825 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. des premiers\nhommes</span> (<span class=\"ital\">cf.</span> <span class=\"grec\">αὐτόχθων</span>), <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 55 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Suppl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">250 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">269</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou des Thébains,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Trag.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Poet.</span> <span class=\"refch\">16, 2</span>)\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> fait de terre,\n<span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Lex.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">7</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> qui est d’origine\nterrestre, <span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span> <span class=\"grec\">Ὀλύμπιοι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">727</span><